</a>

<main class="container">
        
        <section class="fig-image-wrapper">
            <img src="/Source/Animals2/rhino/rhino.jpg" alt="Greater One-horned Rhino Expedition">
            
            <div class="hero-text-overlay">
                <div class="header-title">The Armoured Giant</div>
                <h2 class="header-subtitle">Greater one-horned rhino (Rhinoceros unicornis)</h2>
                <div class="iucn-badge-inline">
                    <span class="iucn-tag">IUCN Status:</span>
                    <span class="iucn-status-value">Vulnerable</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-split">
            
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <div id="carouselTrack">
                    
                    <div class="carousel-slide active">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            Greater one-horned rhinos are the <span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">largest of all rhino species</span>, easily distinguishable by their heavy, plate-like protective skin.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">These prehistoric-looking giants possess a single horn made of keratin—the same protein found in hair and fingernails—which can remarkably regrow if broken. Born without horns, they only develop them around six years of age, utilizing them to forage for roots and uncover food.</p>
                            <p>Their multi-layered skin acts as a natural armour shield, underlain by a strategic layer of fat that regulates temperature while shielding them from sharp branches and thorns. Adult males live a solitary life, while females and calves form small groups, staying close together for up to four years.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            Despite their immense power, these magnificent mammals face critical threats from <span style="color: var(--iucn-vulnerable); font-weight: 700;">human encroachment</span> and environmental shifts.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Illegal hunting and wildlife collection targeting their valuable horns remain a persistent danger, severely challenging conservation efforts. Simultaneously, expanding human intervention continues to fragment and destroy the vital grasslands and forests they depend on.</p>
                            <p>Furthermore, climate change and escalating severe weather events present an unpredictable threat, disrupting the fragile semi-aquatic wetland and riverside habitats across India and Nepal, leaving these giants with fewer places to safely roam.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic" style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                            Support & Experience the Wildlife Firsthand
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; text-align: left;">
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/rhino/rhino-ticket.jpg" alt="Rhino Ticket">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Visit your favourite animals</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">Book your visit today and see all the amazing animals at the zoo!</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Book Now</a>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/rhino/rhino-membership.jpg" alt="Rhino Member">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Become a member and don't miss a thing</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">See these magnificent animals any day you like with free unlimited entry for a year, plus up to 10% off future experiences.</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Become a Member</a>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="carousel-controls">
                    <button id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous Slide">←</button>
                    <span class="slide-indicator" id="slideIndicator">1 / 3</span>
                    <button id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next Slide">→</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-grid">
                
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="15.5" rx="4.5" ry="3.5"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="9.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="10" cy="7.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="14" cy="7.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="9.5" r="1.5"/></svg>
                        Species
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Mammal</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 2h14M5 22h14M7 2l5 8 5-8M7 22l5-8 5 8"/></svg>
                        Life Span
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Up to 40 years</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12,2 3,17 21,17"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="22"/></svg>
                        Habitat
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value" style="font-size: 19px;">Grasslands & Forests</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
                        Region
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">India & Nepal</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22V12" /><path d="M12 12c4-3 5-7 5-7s-4 0-7 4c-1.3 1.7-1.5 3.5-1 4.5z" /><path d="M12 15c-3-1.5-4.5-4.5-4.5-4.5s2.5-.5 4.5 2" /></svg>
                        Diet
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Herbivores</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="8" width="22" height="8" rx="1"/><line x1="5" y1="8" x2="5" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="9" y2="14"/><line x1="13" y1="8" x2="13" y2="12"/><line x1="17" y1="8" x2="17" y2="14"/></svg>
                        Max Weight
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">2800kg (Males)</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="fact-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                        Behaviour & Zoo Location
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value" style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3;">
                        Solitary & Territorial <br>
                        <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Located near the Main Entrance</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <section class="doc-band">
        <div class="dashed-border-top"></div>
        <div class="doc-container">
            <div class="doc-text">
                <h3>Experience the Documentary</h3>
                <p>Journey deeper into the archival footage of the Greater One-horned Rhino conservation mission.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/E4hNjgJ3-Bs?si=rWbflVu2ONRMqh89" target="_blank" class="doc-btn">
                <span class="play-icon">▶</span> Watch Film
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="dashed-border-bottom"></div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
            const totalSlides = slides.length;
            const indicator = document.getElementById('slideIndicator');
            let currentSlide = 0;

            function updateSlide(index) {
                slides.forEach(slide => slide.classList.remove('active'));
                slides[index].classList.add('active');
                indicator.textContent = `0${index + 1} / 0${totalSlides}`;
            }

            document.getElementById('nextBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            document.getElementById('prevBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + totalSlides) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            updateSlide(currentSlide);
        });
    </script>


